      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "There's three good reasons to make an in-house version of the Cloth component.\n\n1. An in-house version should be more optimized than the one built into the engine.\n\n2. More consistency when VRChat decides to go past Unity 2022 into Unity 6.x (another can of worms)\n\n3. If done in-house it'd be Quest compatible, which highlights the first point.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    }
